{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44811","headline":"早发陕州途中赠严秘书 · 清江","name":"早发陕州途中赠严秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此身虽不系，忧道亦劳生。\n万里江湖梦，千山雨雪行。\n人家依旧垒，关路闭层城。\n未尽交河虏，犹屯细柳兵。\n艰难嗟远客，栖托赖深情。\n贫病吾将有，精修许少卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}